// BT-3536 (ADR 0123 Phase 2) regression fixture: a minimal Actor, referenced
// as an Actor-typed field by shape_hazard_cart.bt to exercise
// beamtalk_shape_migration:pack/1's `SendableRef` rejection. A dedicated
// fixture rather than reusing another suite's Actor class — this test file
// registers it lazily on first use, same as every other fixture this test
// file owns, with no ordering dependency on when some other test suite
// happens to register a shared class.

Actor subclass: ShapeHazardWorker
  state: busy :: Boolean = false
